    <briefdescription>
<para>LOAD_HOLIDAYS(calendarName) - Load holidays from external file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Securely loads a holiday calendar from YAML or JSON file.</para>
<para>Security features:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Path injection protection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Whitelisted directories only</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>File size limits</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Content validation</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Examples: LOAD_HOLIDAYS(&quot;germany_2024&quot;) LOAD_HOLIDAYS(&quot;us_federal_2024&quot;) </para>
    </detaileddescription>
